<title>UK: Russia's Novorossiisk, Tuapse ports shut - sources.</title>
<headline>Russia's Novorossiisk, Tuapse ports shut - sources.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Black Sea port of Novorossiisk remained shut on Monday due to a heavy swell after closing on Sunday because of high winds, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>The Black Sea port of Tuapse was also closed, due to bad weather, rain and strong wind, the sources said.</p>
<p>The other Black Sea port of Odessa and the Baltic port of Ventsplis were open.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
